- Complex medication interactions or intolerance to first-line osteoporosis therapies, or if you and your PCP are considering advanced treatments (e.g., teriparatide, denosumab) and want endocrine input.  
- If you have other endocrine risk factors (e.g., prolonged glucocorticoid use, hyperparathyroidism, hypogonadism).  
