I can help — below I’ve put together (A) clarifying questions so I can tailor recommendations, (B) suggested things to review/bring to your PCP visit, (C) specific questions and phrasing to ask Dr. David Nguyen about hypertension and endocrinology referral, and (D) recommended tests to request. If you’d like, I can then draft an email to Dr. Nguyen or create a checklist you can bring to the appointment.

A — Quick clarifying questions
