- “Should we use ambulatory (24-hour) BP monitoring or a home BP log to confirm control or white-coat/masked hypertension?”
- “Do we need labs (basic metabolic panel, potassium) or EKG before any medication changes?”
- “Should I be evaluated for orthostatic hypotension (testing BP supine and standing) given my age/meds?”
- “Are there drug interactions I should worry about with omeprazole or my supplements?”

