- Any history of fragility fractures?
- Do you know your heart-failure type/Ejection Fraction and current HF meds (names/doses)?
- What dose of calcium and vitamin D are you taking?
- Any other major conditions (diabetes, CKD, thyroid disease) or are you a current smoker?

