Below is a focused checklist, suggested questions to ask Dr. Nguyen, tests to request, and guidance about whether an endocrinology referral is likely needed.

Clarifying questions for you before I go further
- Do you know your current resting blood pressure readings (home or clinic) and what antihypertensive meds you’re taking now? (names + doses)
